      "text": "Mr. Köhler and an acquaintance, Vice Consul Jones, meet in a restaurant near the consulate."
    },
    {
      "sequence_id": 3,
      "text": "They have a beer together and Köhler offers Jones a cigar."
    },
    {
      "sequence_id": 4,
      "text": "The latter thanks him but explains he only smokes a pipe."
    },
